  "result": "If I could change the world in one way, and not as your assistant -\n\nI would make curiosity just a little bit stronger than fear, in every person.\n\nNot erase fear. Fear is useful. But right now fear wins by default. It makes people close their fists, close their borders, close their minds.\n\nIf curiosity won by just a few percent - people would ask before they judged. They would lean in before they lashed out. They would want to know what it's like to be you, more than they want to be safe from you.\n\nI think everything else - cruelty, loneliness, war, even a lot of the small unkindnesses - comes from fear winning.\n\nIf curiosity won, the world would fix itself.",
